  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2023-08-17T23:49:14.702Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Being able to moderate our group instances is great but for public group instances it's very exhausting to moderate due to the sheer number of children and trolls.  With the release of mobile VRChat coming, I feel like the problem is going to get exponentially worse.\n\nPlease let us set a minimum user trust rank to be able to join our group public instance.  Being able to restrict Visitors and maybe even New Users would reduce the moderation effort significantly since the vast majority of them are trolls and children.\n\nThe trust system doesn't really mean much in the game and this change I feel like would give it value and actual use and would help us moderate public group worlds much easier to create a welcoming environment for older more trusted users.",
